<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="Kids: Spiders" id="00102f94" height="411" width="574" hasaudio="0" hascredits="1" lang="E" basecontroltype="SlideShowControl" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="kidsWhite" skinlib="kids1"><slides><slide type="standard" sequence="1" slideid="1"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;¿Sabías que las arañas son diferentes de los insectos? Las arañas tienen ocho patas en lugar de seis, y carecen de alas. Las arañas también tienen ocho ojos en lugar de los dos de los insectos. En realidad, los insectos son el alimento favorito de las arañas.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Arañas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00102f94_1.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="164" y="8"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Araña parda&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>0</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>417</x><y>1</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>0</x><y>0</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Araña parda&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="160" y="9" w="91" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>29D26542</imagerefid><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Arañas&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="2" slideid="2"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Muchas arañas tejen sorprendentes telas de seda para capturar a sus presas. Las arañas esperan en el centro hasta que un insecto cae en la tela y queda atrapado en los hilos pegajosos.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Telarañas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00102f94_2.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="91" y="8"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Mariposa atrapada en una telaraña&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>0</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>1</y></point><point><x>416</x><y>376</y></point><point><x>0</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>0</x><y>0</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Mariposa atrapada en una telaraña&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="87" y="9" w="243" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>29D26543</imagerefid><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Telarañas&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="3" slideid="3"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Algunas arañas capturan a sus presas sin emplear una tela. Esperan a que un insecto se aproxime y entonces se abalanzan sobre él. Esta araña saltadora está a punto de atrapar una abeja.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Arañas cazadoras&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00102f94_3.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="127" y="10"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Araña saltadora y abeja&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>0</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>416</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>0</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>0</x><y>0</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Araña saltadora y abeja&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="123" y="11" w="169" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>1B824626</imagerefid><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Arañas cazadoras&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="4" slideid="4"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Las tarántulas son las arañas de mayor tamaño. Como las demás arañas, comen montones de insectos. Pero también pueden matar lagartijas, ratas e incluso pequeñas aves. De todos modos, no debes preocuparte: las tarántulas no son peligrosas para los seres humanos.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Tarántulas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00102f94_4.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="155" y="9"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Tarántula Goliat&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>0</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>415</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>414</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>0</x><y>0</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Tarántula Goliat&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="151" y="10" w="119" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>1B82939B</imagerefid><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Tarántulas&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="standard" sequence="5" slideid="5"><standardslide locklabelson="0" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;La mayoría de las arañas no son peligrosas para los seres humanos. Una excepción es la viuda negra, cuya mordedura es muy venenosa. Afortunadamente, suele evitar a las personas.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Arañas peligrosas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00102f94_5.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="90" y="10"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Hembra de viuda negra con sus crías&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>1</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>416</x><y>1</y></point><point><x>416</x><y>377</y></point><point><x>0</x><y>378</y></point><point><x>1</x><y>0</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Hembra de viuda negra con sus crías&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="86" y="11" w="256" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid>1B823215</imagerefid><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Arañas peligrosas&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide></slides><slideshowcontrol bottombarbgcolorid="3" textdividerbarcolorid="3" creditsbuttonstyleid="2" resetbuttonstyleid="3" navbuttonstyleid="1" numbermenuitems="0" showpop="0" autoadvance="0" shownavarrows="1" bottombarheight="31"><audiocontrollerstyle bgcolorid="3" progresscolorid="3" guttercolorid="3" graphiccolorid="2" outlinecolorid="3" buttonstyleid="1"/><popmenustyle listtextstyleid="5" displaytextstyleid="5" selectedlisttextstyleid="5" rolllisttextstyleid="5" downlisttextstyleid="5" rolloutlinecolorid="3" displaybgcolorid="3" listbgcolorid="2" listoutlinecolorid="4" displayoutlinecolorid="4" popbuttonstyleid="1"><scrollbarstyle guttercolorid="4" thumbbasecolorid="5" thumbrollcolorid="6" thumbdowncolorid="6" buttonstyleid="1"/></popmenustyle><captionscrollbarstyle guttercolorid="4" thumbbasecolorid="5" thumbrollcolorid="6" thumbdowncolorid="6" buttonstyleid="1"/><creditsbuttontext>&lt;html&gt;Credits&lt;/html&gt;</creditsbuttontext><resetbuttontext>&lt;html&gt;Reset&lt;/html&gt;</resetbuttontext><currentslidetext textstyleid="6"><text>&lt;html&gt;% de #&lt;/html&gt;</text></currentslidetext></slideshowcontrol><textstyles><textstyle size="15" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="1" underline="0" colorid="7" align="left" id="1"/><textstyle size="13" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="0" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="7" align